            <ArticleTitle>Rotational ablation of chronic coronary occlusions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>295-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Rotational ablation was performed successfully in three chronic coronary occlusions. At 3 months follow-up, two of the three lesions were patent. These cases illustrate the overall advantages and unique technical aspects of this device.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
